{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# AbilitySystem｜结构图\n共同final生命周期、派生原资源及受控请求点已启用并编译；正常/故障必要行为有限验证。严格raw/native、正式资产与网络仍开放，真实报告见父文档。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_AbilitySystem.canvas|关键调用]] · [[AbilitySystem/计划_原请求终止|终止契约]] · [[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|终止子图]] · [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|伤害]] · [[GGYGO_结构_HitImpact.canvas|命中反馈]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1520,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Input／Hero消费者\nInput管原生Key/Device事实；Hero管Action观测/有限缓冲；ASC唯一held聚合。\nHero A已接ActionInstance→Receive原ID/期限→End／Queue完整Retry。\nB1消费typed本地H；B2装配Source→CMC原会话，均已编译。\nPostProcess唯一驱动Process；旧夹具/混合来源动态未验。\n[[Input/结构|Input合同]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "host",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 持久状态宿主\nSlot/BossState持ASC，Host选择/公布Avatar。\nRequest→ASC事务→Extension Install原H→Host公布→Publish；ActorInfo只归ASC。\nH1原提交cleanup＋显式ClearMode；H2原Operation＋pureScope清理，原Init失败保留。\nHealth/Base/Hero已消费；Host/Extension/Hero已编译，整链动态仍开放。\n[[Combatants/结构|Host接口]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "asc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilitySystemComponent\nReceive／End／Queue签原输入ID；唯一Spec held/queued，有序边沿/逐边沿来源冻结，无第二Tick。\nNotifyAbilityFailed（final）只消费独立Can来源，真实Queued发送完整Retry。\nIsActivationBlockedByGroup只读；NotifyActivated分配sequence/预留，ActiveCount++后Finalize；终检只查权威组登记。\nTryActivateAbilityWithTerminationBoundary提供真实原Try退出见证；OnAbilityTerminationCompleted发布原完成历史。\nASC关联GA原记录的Try/Ended见证，无第二终止状态机。\nClientCorrectAbilityState按Spec/实例/key路由。\nActorInfo唯一事务/发布见下方；已编译，专项/生产边界保留。",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 570,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "config",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 仲裁配置\n`UGGYGOAbilityGroupConfig`：GroupTag → 共存/独占/排队规则。\n`UGGYGOAbilityTagRelationshipMapping`：能力 Tag → 额外要求/阻断/取消 Tag。\n两者由 PawnData 注入 ASC。",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 225,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOGameplayAbility\nCan/Activate/End/Cancel为final；Additional只追加准入业务。\nNotifyActivated时签Original；Capture只复制已有历史，Busy返回空。\nInitialize(Original)初始化原批次；原准入/相机后Body(Original,原参数)执行业务，默认native Super→BP。\nRequestEnd/Cancel核Original，唯一原记录固定首次Context/资源与实际返回义务。\nCleanup(Context)仅归还原批次；GAS仍执行原End/Task清理。\nBuilder显式空GE正常；必需Spec失败false/空输出，响应归调用方。\n[[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|原记录与完成门禁]]",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "set",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilitySet\n`GiveToAbilitySystem(ASC, Handles, Source)` → 按 AttributeSet、GA、GE 顺序授予。\n`GrantedHandles::TakeFromAbilitySystem(ASC)` → 收回这次授予。",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "attr",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## HealthSet / CombatSet\nHealthSet：Damage/Healing/PoiseDamage 元属性与生命、韧性变更委托。\nCombatSet：BaseDamage/BaseHeal/BasePoiseDamage 供 Execution 捕获。",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 1070,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "effect",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 伤害 / 表现接口\nDamageExecution::Execute → Origin到HitPoint距离衰减，写目标元属性。\nEffectContext::Duplicate → 保留显式Origin。\nHitImpact::HandleGameplayCue / OnExecute → K2 / Super前Resolve原输入；默认HitResult必需，不自动换Target。BP可显式选参数位置/目标中心。\n已知表面漏配默认拒绝；原点/Overlap合法。\nGameplayCueManager → 加载/分发；接口/配置/生命周期见[[AbilitySystem/Cues/结构|子模块]]与[[GGYGO_结构_HitImpact.canvas|结构子图]]。",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 1210,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 关键交互契约\nSlot/BossState→AbilitySet→持久ASC，自身Handles精确撤装。Input管物理事实，Hero管自身观测/有限意图，ASC唯一held/queued及原ID/期限；局部End/Retry不全Clear或续期。\nProcess/OnSpawn/Boss BT→一次受控Try；Can来源与实际NotifyActivated原身份分离，remote接受非本地Activation证明。BT持原等待，消费固定Original的同步历史或异步Completed。\nGA唯一原终止记录；ASC只持实际Try/Ended见证并封存后发布；GAS唯一执行。Combo/Boss/Admission已接Initialize/Body/Context Cleanup，Task持自己的精确实例/桶/native订阅资源。\nCombo/Boss调用Combat Owned Window/精确hit订阅，闭包捕Original/原窗口/token；Combat只查询去重。Builder失败时Combo正式End原动作，Boss仅拒该hit；有效Spec应用免疫/拒绝的碰撞Cue保持。\nTask自然Completed、GA早数据通知、ASC原Ended与项目Notice时点不同；完整契约见[[AbilitySystem/计划_原请求终止|原请求计划]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1570,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4exec",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一UGGYGOASC｜ActorInfo事务与一次发布\nGetAvatarBindingContext / CheckAvatarBindingContext → 唯一身份读取／核对。\nTryExecuteAvatarActorInfoTransaction → 精确Current正常准入。\nTryBootstrapAvatarActorInfoTransaction → Unissued且完整空Context。\nTryReplaceRevokedAvatarActorInfoTransaction → 精确Revoked显式替换；三者不互为错误兜底。\nIsAvatarBindingNativeWriteBusy → 包住完整Super、返回重检及Commit；窗口内Busy，不排队。\nInvalidateAvatarBinding → 撤工作/匹配发布许可，保留原提交快照仅作cleanup；真实ActorInfo写前退休。\nPublishAvatarBindingNotice(Receipt, Query) → 校验原Proof／Context／实际字段及必需同步纯谓词，一次事件与逐项GA通知。\nIsAvatarBindingNoticeDispatching(Receipt) → 仅精确真实Dispatching；Pending／历史不通过。\nIsAvatarBindingPublicationContextCurrent(Context) → 仅当前Dispatching／成功Consumed，不是全局Ready。\nASC独占一个发布记录与阶段；失败Closed、成功Consumed分开，无第二Avatar／Issuer／历史队列。\n发布不占原生Busy；合法B接续后，A历史bCommitted保留、返回Stale，只清A。\n旧Init／Clear／项目Refresh仍独占原生窗口；基类非虚Refresh绕行不在保障内。\n历史Gate43执行四叶与P1/R1发布专项通过。下方两cleanup来源、Host H1/H2及Hero A/B1/B2已实施并编译；R0 Gate42原2 Fail/12错误保留，完整生产/Destroy动态未闭合。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2080,
      "width": 730,
      "height": 900,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4receipt",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAvatarBindingPublicationReceipt\nTryGetCommittedEvidence(Result, Notice) → 先清输出，只复制历史；true不等于当前绑定／发布／Ready。\nASC唯一创建私有const Proof；保存原Kind、Before弱端点、Result／Notice，复制共享历史资源。\nInit／Refresh描述After；Clear为Released并保留Before，owner-only Init不等同Clear。\nPublish须另核对当前原Proof；历史副本仍可读取，却不能清后继或执行新动作。\n历史Gate43已验证历史与失败复位；Host/Extension/Hero已消费并编译，新增生产/清理动态边界仍开放。",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 2080,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4notice",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAvatarBindingNoticeEvent\nASC持有原生多播的私有封装；仅ASC可Broadcast，外部不能复制或转成可广播基类。\nASC::OnAvatarBindingNotice() → 借用订阅入口。\nAddUObject／AddWeakLambda等 → 原调用方的监听句柄。\nRemove(Handle)／RemoveAll(Object) → 撤自己的监听。\n参数：const Receipt& 与 const Notice&，原历史载荷不当当前权限。\n接收者须查IsAvatarBindingNoticeDispatching并核对自身原资源。\n实际消费者：[[Combatants/结构|Host]]原Dispatching桥接[[Character/结构|Extension]]真实Ready；Health/Base/Hero消费自己的原H，已编译。\n历史P1/R1发布与PendingRemove两叶通过，不代替完整生产动态验收。",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 2700,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 500,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4cancel",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一ASC｜原归属限定清理\nTryCancelAvatarBindingAbilities(Expected, With, Without, pureQuery)：原Context／业务筛选／原清理资源；null With不筛选，非null空With匹配零，标签栈复制。\nTryRemoveAvatarBindingGameplayCues(Expected, pureQuery)：原清理作用域，不依赖Ready或已撤本地缓存；一次原生Active Tag清理，不承诺全Cue结束。\n二者复用I1/native Busy与MatchCommittedCleanupContext：Query前后/完整返回核原Current或Revoked提交来源，关匹配发布许可后一次Super/Complete；不改Binding/ActorInfo，无Commit/Receipt/Notice。\n失效只退原Operation，不清后继／回滚已发生动作，无第二执行器。\n历史C1a Gate48筛选/Busy/B接续、C1b Gate49R1真实Removed/Busy专项通过。[[Combatants/结构|Host]] H1/H2、ASC两来源与Hero已实施并编译；完整生产换绑/Destroy动态仍开放。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3260,
      "width": 730,
      "height": 560,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ability-input-original-resource-values",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1670,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 700,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## 原输入接口／普通值｜已接Hero并编译\nFGGYGOAbilityInputRequestIdentity：原weak ASC＋InputRevision＋非零RequestSerial；rev0合法，弱身份保持index/serial。\nFGGYGOAbilityInputRetryRequest：InputTag＋Identity＋原World有限绝对OriginalDeadline；默认-1无效。\nReceiveAbilityInputRequest(Tag,PreviousID,Deadline)：空ID签原请求；非空仅复核原资源，冻结首次Spec集合／Owner/Avatar/World。\nEndAbilityInputRequest(ID,Kind)：Released最后来源发释放且保留有限tap；Invalidated退休不伪Released，原义务不借当前Ready。\nQueueAbilityInputRetry(const OriginalRetry&)：完整ID/Tag/deadline＋真实Queued许可，不延长窗口或替held。\nOnAbilityInputRetryable(const OriginalRetry&)：本次Can精确来源，不按Tag找最近请求。\nResult只为Accepted/AlreadyApplied/Rejected/Stale历史，不代表技能激活；这些值不持第二held权威。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#单次 Can 评估与输入失败来源（B0）|完整契约/实现/边界]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "k3-playback-asc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一ASC｜精确原Local播放来源\nTryPlayMontageWithOwnership(GA,Activation,Montage,Rate,Section,Time,pureQuery)：完整Super／Guard后认证源与Local一致，返回单一Result，成功才签Playback。\nCheckMontagePlaybackOwnership(Original)：纯原资源校验，停止／无活动实例不丢清理资格。\nCaptureMontagePlaybackOwnership(原GA,Spec,Activation)：只取已有认证记录；缺失NoOwnedPlayback，不造新Handle。\nTryClearMontageAnimatingAbility(Original)：精确Check后仅基类GA setter／Local清空，退休原记录；不Stop／延迟混出。\n唯一provenance持原ActorInfo快照，不是播放状态／第二执行器。\n实际Init／Clear退休；同端点Refresh无真实变化则保留。原生可截获入口核对，拒绝外层不清后继。\nASC/Task及GA原Capture已编译，Combo/Boss已迁原消费者；旧严格重入、正式资产/网络仍开放。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#精确Montage播放归属（K3：已编译，派生与生产未闭合）|完整契约]]",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 860,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "k3-playback-values",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原Handle／结果与Animation接缝\nFGGYGOAbilityMontagePlaybackHandle：私有const Proof，仅ASC签发；HasPlayback／HasSamePlayback只读身份。\nProof含原ASC、GA／Spec／ActivationKey、Montage、Guard完整证据与Local计数一致性；8位计数不是唯一身份。\nResult／Check／Clear：Outcome＋Reason＋Guard历史＋原Handle；Failed不补成功资源。\nAnimation Guard唯一提供生命周期／非复用CallId／CreatedInstanceId，ASC认证真实Local写入；Task只持原资源。\n未观察Owner ABA／限定基类绕行不冒称已截获，无网络协议或帧调度。\n[[Animation/结构|Guard接口]] · [[AbilitySystem/计划_AbilitySystem#当前精确Montage增量（K3）|阶段与缺口]]",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 680,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "k3-task-resource-consumer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilityTask_PlayMontageAndWaitForEvent\nPlayMontageAndWaitForEvent／ResolvePlayRate → 配置与同次速率，五BP签名保持。\nN0：FNativeCallbacks五可选单播；RegisterNativeCallbacks仅原Awaiting/preReady非空、无重复；Unregister按原token先脱包，构造/析构重入不覆盖后继。\n原Activation/弱GA/弱原Task由调用方闭包捕获；Task不另签GA身份。\nActivate → ASC.TryPlayMontageWithOwnership，纯原Task／ActorInfo查询；成功才存原Handle／Guard并按CreatedInstanceId绑定精确实例委托。\nIsNotifyValid → 原源／精确实例播放＋ASC.Check原Handle才接GameplayEvent；先复制负载再广播。\nOnMontageBlendingOutForInstance → 释放自身缩放，TryClear原Handle；A不借同GA/资产清B。\nOnMontageEndedForInstance → 原Guard＋原上下文＋AbilityTask资格，非打断发布Completed事实；不Check已退休当前归属，不授后继GA End权限。\n七分支：原包/载荷快照→native及捕获析构返回→弱原Task/路径资格重检→BP；Event核IsNotifyValid，Blend/Ended核原Guard/ActorInfo/Task资格。\n三取消入口预标记，各渠道至多一次；启动失败无须尚未建立的ActorInfo/Guard。OnDestroy先脱包/token，再自身监听/实例/scale清理；旧cleanup/Super后释放捕获，无Task访问。栈共持原停止义务。\n停止只按原Guard实例；精确ASC认证＋活动ID才CurrentMontageStop，否则仅原本地资源释放，不改新ASC/GA。\n无全局播放尝试表/播放token/新实例扫描；native注册token仅为订阅资源，无第二能力/播放状态。\nCombo/Boss已在Ready前注册原native包并精确脱token；Task Completed不是GA原Notice。普通资源链有限验证，native/捕获析构极端重入、旧夹具和资产网络仍开放。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#Task原实例与资源消费（已编译，专项与迁移边界保留）|接口/实现/清理]] · [[Animation/结构|Guard职责]]",
      "x": 3500,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 860,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4-committed-cleanup-source",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一ASC｜已提交cleanup来源\nCheckAvatarBindingCleanupContext(Expected, OutReason) const → 纯GT认证原Issuer/Context/LastWrite、ActorInfo allocation与完整快照；Current或Revoked，不执行/签发/Ready。\n单个AvatarBindingActorInfoSnapshot：逻辑撤销保留cleanup；真实typed/legacy写前退休，同端点也不续权。\nWorkingBinding仍Current/live；CommittedCleanup允许仍合法分配且Destroy中的原Owner/Avatar，无效ASC/字段变化明确失败。\nCancel/Cue/Clear消费同一来源/原native窗口；关闭Owner或宿主PreserveOwner→LifecycleClosed，调用方显式ClearActorInfo，不失败后换模式。\nTyped Clear沿既有提交/Released契约；query本身不发布。\nASC及Host H1已实施并编译；原Destroy/完整换绑动态仍开放。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原已提交清理来源（Destroy）|来源/失效/模式]]",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 3260,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 650,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4-failed-init-cleanup-proof",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一ASC｜未commit Init原写入证明\n私有const FFailedAvatarActorInfoInitCleanupProof持OriginalOperation、Before、完整WrittenActual；原allocation防复用，Actor弱引用，不存caller闭包。\n普通/Bootstrap/Replace的native Init完整返回后捕获；未commit失败且原场景仍匹配才保留，成功commit不保留。\nTryCleanupFailedAvatarActorInfoInit(原Operation, pureOriginalCallerQuery) → 核成员原Proof/Before/allocation/全字段，query在既有Busy内前后重检。\n先消费Proof再唯一qualified Super::ClearActorInfo；核真实清空后置条件，raw AnimInstance/Tag按GAS保留。\nSucceeded只为物理cleanup，bCommitted=false、Context空，无Receipt/Notice/Ready；原Init仍失败，native后失败不重发Proof。\n后继真实typed/legacy写、消费或ASC销毁释放；无第二绑定/序号/队列/执行器。\nASC及Host H2已实施并编译；失败Init完整生产清理动态仍开放。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#失败Init原写入清理（未提交证明）|来源/消费/后置条件]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4080,
      "width": 730,
      "height": 790,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4-cleanup-host-consumer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 清理调用方｜Host消费接缝\n[[Combatants/结构|CombatantState]]持自己的选择/H/请求scope，ASC独占写入与证明，[[Character/结构|Extension]]独占本地通知资源。\nH1已实施并编译：原提交用CheckAvatarBindingCleanupContext，不借Ready阻挡Closing；Release和已提交失败显式选ClearMode。\nH2已实施并编译：Init/owner-only失败消费原Operation＋pure原scope，原Init仍失败。\n清理/初始化scope分开；不查后继Context借权，不回滚或自动重试。\n历史Build55失败、当时Hero未迁移保留在父文档；当前Hero A/B1/B2已实施并编译。R0原失败与完整Avatar/Destroy/资产/网络仍开放；GA派生共同生命周期当前事实见父文档。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#清理调用方与本轮验证边界|消费/验证门禁]]",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 4080,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 750,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "w0-original-input-subscription",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilityTask_WaitComboInput｜W0\n输入：OwningAbility、可更新SourceStep、可选FGGYGOComboInputNativeDelegate(int32,int32)。\nWaitComboInput返回未Ready Task；RegisterNativeCallback仅原pre-Ready非空/单注册，输出精确FDelegateHandle；UnregisterNativeCallback返回是否匹配，先脱包再释放，不擦掉捕获析构重入后的后继。\nTask只持不可变原弱ASC/Ability、Spec/key、remote/predict模式与自身handle；原Activation仅调用方按值闭包。零key合法，桶不是GA身份。\n作用/输出：原GAS InputPressed读/发/Consume→native及捕获析构返回→弱原Task/原订阅核验→原OnPress BP；工厂/SetSourceStep/BP、65535校验与预测规则保持。\n清理：OnDestroy先关/脱资源，再原桶remove自身handle；不Consume后继，Super/清理后释放捕获，无Task写尾。同步回放结束不写Waiting；无效依赖明确诊断并结束自身。\nW0及Combo native消费者已启用并编译；固定Original/原Task闭包和精确token归Combo原批次。正常纠正/必要资源收尾有限验证，native/捕获析构重入、remote同步回放与正式输入/网络仍开放。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原事件桶与输入Task订阅（W0）|输入／作用／输出与清理]]\n[[AbilitySystem/计划_AbilitySystem#当前连段输入Task增量（W0）|W0实施边界]]",
      "x": 3500,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 760,
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
